},"如果「觉得自己丑」已经到反复照镜子、反复想改的程度，先做一次体像评估再谈手术"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/28-09","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"矫正牙齿要找有正畸资质的医生当面检查、按时复诊，别网购牙套自己在家戴"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page","data-tip-locales":"zh,en,ru,es,ja,vi"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"当前位置"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book"},"children":["阅读全书"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book/28"},"children":["第 28 章 · 别为了外形把身体搞坏"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"28-01"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["01"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["证据 A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"zh"},"children":["不要用极端节食、断食或催吐来控制体重，要减就从运动那一侧减"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"zh","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["神经性厌食的人，死亡概率大约是同龄人的 5.9 倍。每 1000 个人跟一年，死 5.1 个。死的人里每五个有一个是自杀。而它的入口就是节食：跟踪 44 所中学的学生三年，严重节食的女生出现进食障碍的概率是不节食的 18 倍。想控制体重就多运动，别少吃到饿。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["不花钱。反过来还省下买减肥产品的钱。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["36 项研究合起来算。神经性厌食这一批人累计被跟踪了 166,642 人年（每人被跟踪的年数加总）。他们的标准化死亡比是 5.86，即死亡概率约为同龄人的 5.9 倍。每 1000 人年死亡 5.1 例，就是 1000 个人跟一年死 5.1 个。死的人里约 1/5 死于自杀。贪食症的标准化死亡比是…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：不要用极端节食、断食或催吐来控制体重，要减就从运动那一侧减"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱。反过来还省下买减肥产品的钱。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["36 项研究合起来算。神经性厌食这一批人累计被跟踪了 166,642 人年（每人被跟踪的年数加总）。他们的标准化死亡比是 5.86，即死亡概率约为同龄人的 5.9 倍。每 1000 人年死亡 5.1 例，就是 1000 个人跟一年死 5.1 个。死的人里约 1/5 死于自杀。贪食症的标准化死亡比是 1.93，其他进食障碍是 1.92，即各约为同龄人的 1.9 倍。另一项研究在澳大利亚维多利亚州的 44 所中学做，跟踪 14–15 岁学生 3 年、同一批学生三年里前后查了 6 波。女生新发进食障碍 21.8/1000 人年，即 1000 个女生跟一年新出 21.8 例。严重节食的女生发病风险是不节食者的 18 倍，中度节食者是 5 倍。再校正既往节食与精神症状，把「以前就节食过」和「本来就有精神症状」的影响扣掉。扣掉之后，BMI（体重除以身高平方算出的胖瘦指标）、运动量和性别都不再预测新发进食障碍。作者结论是「在青少年中用运动而非限食控制体重，发生进食障碍的风险似乎更低」"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Arcelus J et al. (2011). Mortality rates in patients with anorexia nervosa and other eating disorders. A meta-analysis of 36 studies. Arch Gen Psychiatry. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1001/archgenpsychiatry.2011.74","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1001/archgenpsychiatry.2011.74"]},"；Patton GC et al. (1999). Onset of adolescent eating disorders: population based cohort study over 3 years. BMJ. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.318.7186.765","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1136/bmj.318.7186.765"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["这里说的「严重节食」，指的是长期把吃的压到远低于身体需要，不是指少吃一顿或者不吃夜宵。已经出现催吐、暴食之后自责、反复称重停不下来的，去精神科或者综合医院的临床心理科看。这是有规范治疗办法的病，不是意志力的问题。BMI 与死亡率的关系见第 2 节第 32 条，那条讲长期体重区间，不讲减重手段。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/28-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"打针、埋线、开刀之前查两样：机构许可证上有没有「医疗美容」，动手的人是不是主诊医师"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/28-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["面部填充避开鼻背、眉间、额头这几个部位，更别为省钱找非正规注射"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["打填充针后失明的人里，一半多打的是鼻部，其次是眉间、额头和法令纹，八成多用的是玻尿酸。失明的人只有两成视力完全恢复，一成多部分恢复，将近两成还伤到了脑。目前没有…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/28-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要买承诺「快速瘦」的减肥药、减肥咖啡、瘦身糖果和酵素梅（号称泡过酵素的梅子）"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["这类产品里最常查出偷加的是西布曲明，它原来是减肥药，2010 年在中国被停掉了。有心脏病或糖尿病的超重的人吃了三年多，没致命的心梗高约三成，中风高约三成六。体重…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/28-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不要用合成代谢类固醇（「增肌针」「口服药」）来长肌肉"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["健身房兴奋剂检测阳性的男性，死亡风险是同龄人的 3 倍，每年跑医院的次数多一倍多。痤疮、男性乳房发育、勃起功能障碍，每十个用药的人里至少一个中招。这类药在中国是…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/28-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["要吃减肥药就去医院拿处方，别在不用处方就发货的网店买"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["处方药必须凭处方卖，网上卖也必须有真实处方并且实名。不问诊、不要处方、下单就发货的，要么卖的不是它说的药，要么这家店在违规。出了事，没人替你的剂量和禁忌负责。挂…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/28-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["性激素类药只在医生开方并定期复查的前提下用，不要网购、不要自己加量"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["这条不讨论该不该用，只讨论怎么用。用雌激素的跨性别女性，血管里长血块的比同龄人明显多，每一千人两年多出约 4 个，八年多出约 17 个。这类风险得靠定期复查盯着…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/28-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["如果「觉得自己丑」已经到反复照镜子、反复想改的程度，先做一次体像评估再谈手术"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["去做整形手术的人里约 15% 有躯体变形障碍，就是把别人基本看不出的缺陷放大到影响生活。去皮肤科求美的人